bundles the .NET runtime and the third-party components listed below. This
notice lists those components and reproduces the licenses that require it.

HOW THIS LIST WAS PRODUCED
--------------------------
Enumerated from the NuGet restore graph of src/diSerial.App
(obj/project.assets.json, 65 packages). Each license was read from that
package's own .nuspec, or from the license file bundled inside the package.
Nothing here was written from memory or looked up on the web.

Regenerate the same way whenever dependencies change.

Some packages below carry native assets for platforms diSerial does not ship
(Android, Linux, macOS, WebAssembly). They belong to the restore graph and are
listed for completeness; the Windows build does not redistribute those binaries.

