.NET Runtime
============
The self-contained build bundles the .NET runtime. Three packages are published
and each bundles the runtime for its own architecture:

  win-x86    package -> Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x86 10.0.10
  win-x64    package -> Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-x64 10.0.10
  win-arm64  package -> Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.win-arm64 10.0.10

